  "subject": "🤖 AI Agents Daily — GPT-6.2 Astra: OpenAI's Self-Improving AI Just Got Cheaper | November 17, 2026",
  "htmlBody": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\" />\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <title>🤖 AI Agents Daily — GPT-6.2 Astra: OpenAI's Self-Improving AI Just Got Cheaper | November 17, 2026</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f0f0f0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ OUTER WRAPPER -->\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#f0f0f0\"\n       style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:24px 10px;\">\n\n      <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n      <table width=\"680\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr><td>\n      <![endif]-->\n\n      <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MAIN CONTAINER -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n             style=\"max-width:680px;border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── HEADER -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"\n              style=\"padding:40px 30px 28px 30px;border-bottom:2px solid #009c6d;\">\n\n            <!-- Logo emoji -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:40px;line-height:1;margin-bottom:12px;\">🤖</div>\n\n            <!-- Publication title -->\n            <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:-0.5px;\n                        line-height:1.2;\">\n              AI Agents Daily\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Tagline -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;color:#666666;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.5;\">\n              AI developments that matter for financial institutions\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Date -->\n            <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#999999;\n                      font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">\n              November 17, 2026\n            </p>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────── DEEP DIVE SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:40px 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Deep Dive 🔍\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article title -->\n            <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a1a1a;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;line-height:1.4;\">\n              GPT-6.2 Astra: OpenAI's Self-Improving AI Just Got Cheaper\n            </h3>\n\n            <!-- Deep dive article body (HTML from Claude, inline-styled by email-builder) -->\n            <div style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;\n                        font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">\n              <h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Overview</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><strong>OpenAI just raised the ceiling on AI capability — and cut the cost to get there.</strong> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTFBDaTZYQnNSRDloYjlHdkxXeTNaVmxMZUI4b2JzSHZLOENYUFZ3QUJjQnd1c3gxQjlPLWVEOVIydHF2dXFwbk5sakNCVkZyRjYzakl3a3NSME9CQy1Gd1ktbHRlU0JUR1NCMk9xTWtRNDhKYkhrOUFrMDk5NFJXUQ\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:none;\">GPT-6.2 Astra</a> is the first AI model to earn a \"High\" self-improvement rating, while its API price drops 20%. A cheaper, more capable frontier model lands on every bank's cost-benefit analysis this week.</p><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">The Details</h3><ul style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;padding:0 0 0 20px;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">OpenAI released two new models: <strong>GPT-6.2 Astra</strong> (flagship performance) and <strong>GPT-6.2 Sol</strong> (efficiency-focused), expanding its product lineup</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">GPT-6.2 Astra is the first model to receive a <strong>\"High\" self-improvement rating</strong> — a new capability benchmark signaling the model can meaningfully refine its own outputs</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Astra API pricing cut by <strong>20%</strong>, making high-volume enterprise deployments materially more cost-effective</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">Benchmarks show GPT-6.2 Astra outperforms Fable 5.2 and Gemini 4 Carbon on select tasks</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\">The two-model strategy (performance vs. efficiency) mirrors tiered AI architectures many banks already use for routing workloads</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:24px 0 10px 0;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.1em;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding-bottom:8px;\">Why It Matters</h3><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">For banks running GPT-class models in credit underwriting, compliance monitoring, and customer service, a 20% API price reduction shifts the economics of automation use cases. Projects that were marginal at previous pricing now pencil out. Expect accelerated deployment timelines across ops-heavy functions in 2027.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:16px;color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.75;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\">The <strong>\"High\" self-improvement rating</strong> is the detail risk and audit teams cannot ignore. It signals this model can refine its own behavior within defined parameters — creating new model governance obligations for banks in regulated workflows. Stricter versioning controls and behavioral drift monitoring will be non-negotiable for institutions deploying Astra in production.</p>\n            </div>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Deep Dive → Things to Know -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n            </tr></table>\n            <![endif]-->\n            <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n            <div style=\"width:50%;height:3px;background-color:#009c6d;margin:0 auto;\"></div>\n            <!--<![endif]-->\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── THINGS TO KNOW SECTION -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 30px 0 30px;\">\n\n            <!-- Section header -->\n            <h2 style=\"margin:0 0 22px 0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#009c6d;\n                        font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;line-height:1.3;\">\n              Things to Know 👀\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Things to Know entries injected by email-builder -->\n            \n      <!-- TTK entry 1 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            1. <strong>Fed Governor Michael Barr Warns AI Agents Could Trigger Bank Runs Within Minutes</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE9vWEdncV96bjJJa2ZadFhlbkQzVkJMRU9US3l6QTJVb2lxeGZnRHlNc216bDJyN2Y0M0pOdW90YWp1N0ZrQ21nR3AxMlMyZXg4ZnhtQ2lmNEZWdU5vY3FWYlhUUEVtXy1iV1hGYkxKNFFpaC1qSmhXbXM4M3o\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">Hokanews</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Federal Reserve Governor Michael Barr warned that AI agents operating at machine speed could trigger bank runs in minutes — far faster than the hours regulators have historically relied on to intervene. The warning marks a significant shift in how central banks view agentic AI as a systemic risk.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Systemic risk is now measured in minutes, not hours.</strong> Banks need automated circuit breakers and AI transaction monitoring capable of detecting and halting agent-driven liquidity crises before human oversight can engage.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 2 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            2. <strong>Regulators Converge on Twin Compliance Challenges From AI Agents</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPaHJZUlcwalFGN3lhR0xBUlJaYWNlUWRKUlN1MW42LUw1amlpbkExVDhfVWNPZmQ0UXdaYjJyT2FRZGhJNnk0ZE5nbnhCb2phal9rZjBwTUt0R0RvVjBxN2ltVHVpTi1pTTAyTGZyWF9tcHVIY2lEYzczR0o1S0hsNnNzb25ORThKRGJLSzBoWjVJYUE0bkg2QjJyNnRuZ2JhWU1XclZyX2xFQ0ozWWhkdUJRRGh6TnYtM2k5U01R\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">PYMNTS.com</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Regulators are aligning around two AI agent compliance concerns: accountability gaps when agents take autonomous actions, and bias amplification across automated decisions at scale. Formal guidance is expected in early 2027.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Accountability gaps need to close now.</strong> Banks deploying autonomous agents must establish clear decision audit trails and human escalation procedures before regulators mandate them.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 3 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            3. <strong>Plaid launches Agent Detection for AI agents</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQelhzNTNYbEkyVi15SmhnLXVVY3V3ZGNyckNMZXpBNTRjVnh0Szc0bWtmX0kxTVVpeThxS24wVUlpdHM4RlhVTHZuYTlLcUdLTFhYRm9oSW9yQ3Ota2xaY25Pck5oRjM4UzVDMHIyWkFGRTVhYTNfRUlYZWk3QlBveC1fUDE5WDFSWTRHZHdralNuSndESTVldUxocGlQZHVjR1VuNDNXSmRWN28\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">The Paypers</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Plaid launched Agent Detection, an API that enables banks and fintechs to identify whether API calls originate from an AI agent or a human user — addressing a growing blind spot as agentic AI intermediates more financial transactions.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Know who — or what — is on the other end.</strong> Agent Detection gives compliance and fraud teams visibility to apply agent-specific risk rules before autonomous transactions become the default.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 4 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            4. <strong>Arva AI Secures $20M Series A to Automate Critical Banking Decisions with Proprietary AI Models</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPZFE4cGdRZUFBYXdEWXV4MU1EQ1k2cE1xM1I5b0hnNVg0SnBrQklsU185Ri1Ea0owMHhzXzM3RmlROUdERXZOUHZlYWZOT2Z2ek1jamRvMFFBbWRJX0d0VWpQU2o1Yy15aF9zU250RnF1ZXJwX2hSUEs3RklyUFRRbjBBTnJaRkFRallFQ09IQWxfcWlrdHM4Uk9CV0VuY0NQcG8zb3QtQ0oxYWtYNVVLelFudw\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FF News</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Arva AI raised $20M Series A to build proprietary AI models that automate critical banking decisions — lending, risk assessment, and compliance — using bank-specific training data rather than general-purpose models.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Domain-specific AI is pulling ahead of general LLMs in finance.</strong> Arva's approach suggests the next competitive differentiator will be AI trained exclusively on financial data, leaving banks using off-the-shelf models at a disadvantage.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 5 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            5. <strong>Microsoft jabs at OpenAI and Anthropic, touting cheaper, customizable AI models of its own</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQX0pCVkNJTDc2MENyM3Y1Q0hJRzRyQkg3U2NxVGp1eXRzd2RsM1JNa1BlSkxQckZuSFVLZk1lMmZwdHJPN00xTWVQZi1rUURyTnQzNTlISXhVX1RMalNPMXhZLVpWVXc5eVQzcmZSYlVrY2psVERzN1MzMzY3TElCbUFNWkhBS1dSeklnOGVMVkdSSnVjeUxMUGxmbWFhOGlWWVN4SEtwQ2RhRUFUVG9mNF93UC1XQjczcnBR\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">GeekWire</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Microsoft is positioning its own AI models as cheaper and more customizable alternatives to OpenAI and Anthropic, signaling a strategic decoupling as it competes with its former partners on AI infrastructure pricing.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>The enterprise AI market is fracturing.</strong> Banks sourcing AI from Microsoft now have a credible in-house alternative to frontier providers, giving procurement teams meaningful leverage in contract negotiations.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Rule between entries -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:16px 0 20px 0;\">\n            <div style=\"height:1px;background-color:#e5e5e5;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n      <!-- TTK entry 6 -->\n      <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"\n             style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n\n        <!-- Headline -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 4px 0;font-size:16px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#1a1a1a;line-height:1.4;\">\n            6. <strong>Backbase Appoints Dual CTOs to Lead Digital and Agentic Banking Strategy</strong>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Source (linked) -->\n        \n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 8px 0;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n                     color:#009c6d;\">\n            <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQckhDUERKTDdBbS1HMGo4MVQxcWJCa0lXMWpYWnp4VWFHbjFOTjBCS3JjS0xmRlJQaTJLdEoxTFVaSFQzZmZ4UUZtUy16UGlyTThDMEx4LU95cU95Yl90b0FYYXR3T2YxaFRSYnF1c3REYkw2elRfQnhFNVBzWmZDVkZjNXRkN0FCSm1hYkozMUVDRkxxQmp3\" style=\"color:#009c6d;text-decoration:underline;\">FF News</a>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- Summary -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:0 0 10px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.7;\">\n            Backbase appointed two CTOs — one for digital banking and one dedicated to agentic banking strategy — signaling that technology leadership at major banking platforms is reorganizing around agentic AI as a distinct operational layer.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Key point callout -->\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:14px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n                     color:#333333;line-height:1.6;background-color:#f8f8f8;\n                     border-left:3px solid #009c6d;margin-bottom:6px;\">\n            🧠 <strong>Banks need dedicated agentic AI leadership.</strong> Backbase's split-CTO model reflects emerging consensus that autonomous AI requires separate governance from traditional digital banking; expect incumbents to follow.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n        \n        <!-- Spacer after last entry -->\n        <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n\n      </table>\n\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n\n        <!-- ─────────────────────────────── DIVIDER: Things to Know → Startups -->\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:36px 0;\">\n            <!--[if (gte mso 9)|(IE)]>\n            <table width=\"340\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\"><tr>\n            <td height=\"3\" bgcolor=\"#009c6d\" style=\"font-siz